description=AOSP's IMS stack (Android 17 ImsStack + ImsMedia, IWLAN, QNS) for LineageOS 22.2 on the LG V30. VoLTE, SMS over IMS, Wi-Fi calling. Systemless: nothing in /system is modified, removal is a module toggle.
